e, the area of the parallelogram spanned by $\\overset{\\to }{AB}$ and $\\overset{\\to }{AC}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =|\\overset{\\to }{AB}\\times \\overset{\\to }{AC}| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{3}^{2}+(-3)^{2}+(-4)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{34}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, the area of the triangle is half of the area of the respective parallelogram. So, the area of $△\\,ABC$ is\n\n$$\n{A}_{△}=\\frac{1}{2}A=\\frac{\\sqrt{34}}{2}.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14065453/state.json" "file_sha256" "e4a975719eb4442217acafcdb9e97baebacf667b0c631b5184425470c4b4524a"} {"question" "q-275224" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14065453/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "d5c5db25945cf065904539ec2f51ea16f35ef136d3df2b95fcc938e9fc1fca9f"} {"question" "q-275224" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14065453/state.json" "file_sha256" "e4a975719eb4442217acafcdb9e97baebacf667b0c631b5184425470c4b4524a"} {"question" "q-275224" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{\\sqrt{34}}{2}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14065453/state.json" "file_sha256" "e4a975719eb4442217acafcdb9e97baebacf667b0c631b5184425470c4b4524a"}] "usage" {"q-127915" []} "basis" 2151 "retractions" [] "immutable_answers" [17592186324596 17592186324597 17592186324598 17592186324599 17592186324600] "immutable_fields" [[17592186324595 :answer-field/correct] [17592186324595 :answer-field/id] [17592186324595 :answer-field/key] [17592186324595 :answer-field/type]] "no_history" []}
